clinical_features[1]:
  - type: features
    features[4]: Condyle fracture or trauma arthritis,Pain and trismus of traumatic arthritis resolve after one week,Micro-trauma from parafunction may result in chronic symptoms,Dislocation is usually a result of trauma and is rare; very rarely it occurs after yawning
